4
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:38,480
Inkayo matagtrabaho ijay kaubasan.

5
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,540
Taitad kontotirumbang atang danyo.

6
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,480
Itikasta, napanda.

7
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:48,560
Rimuar manin day di lalaki iti alas 12.

8
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:50,820
Kan iti alas 3.

9
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:52,960
Idi danda ni alas 5.

10
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,000
Napan itichendaan,

11
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:58,960
kaya't nakita nati sumagmamano ala laki ng agtatakder.

12
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,320
Kinunan na kadakwada.

13
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:06,020
Apay at atdada alin yung tichempo yung agmal malam dito eh.

14
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,160
Awan nga min pagtrabahuan mi, insungbat da.

15
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:12,160
Imbaga na kadakwada.

16
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:15,600
Inkayo matagtrabaho iti kaubasan.

17
00:01:16,420 --> 00:01:17,480
Idi sumip ngayon,

18
00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:21,620
kinunati akin kukwa iti kaubasan iti katalik na.

19
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:25,280
Ayabam dagiti mang mangged tatangdana mi da.

20
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:28,260
Irogim kadagiti na udi asimrek.

21
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:29,260
Natangdana.

22
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,380
Kanan iti gagangay asweldo iti agmalam,

23
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:36,960
titunggal may sa kadagiti nang rugi anagtrabaho iti alas 5.

24
00:01:37,940 --> 00:01:40,420
Idi napan dagiti imununa anayaban.

25
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:44,060
Impagarup da nga at aduti awaten da.

26
00:01:45,380 --> 00:01:49,100
Ngayam na ipadamit titangdanda kadagiti na ud-udi.

27
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:51,240
Inawat da titangdanda.

28
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:54,320
Ngayam dinayomuduman da tinagpatrabaho.

29
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:55,460
Kinunada.

30
00:01:56,020 --> 00:01:59,460
May salayang nga oras tipa nagtrabaho dagitoy na udi asimrek.

31
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,140
Ngayam da kami anagmal malim anagkap kapudutan.

32
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:05,360
Impadam titangdanda mi.

33
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:06,620
Kayem,

34
00:02:07,340 --> 00:02:10,880
kinunati akin kukwa iti kaubasan iti may sa kadagwada.

35
00:02:12,060 --> 00:02:13,280
Saan ka asina or?

36
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:18,300
Imanamong ka amatangdanan iti gagangay asweldo iti agmalam.

37
00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:21,800
Alaam titangdanda mo kat pumanaw kan.

38
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:26,480
Kayat kung ayipada titangdanda mo iti intangdanda ko iti na udi.

39
00:02:27,140 --> 00:02:29,980
Awan ayat tikalintagak amang gasto iti kukulang.

40
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,840
Huwarta kas itipagayatak.

41
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:33,540
Wenno?

42
00:02:34,580 --> 00:02:35,500
Umapal kakadi.

43
00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:37,520
Agsipod tanaparaburak.

44
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:40,240
Ingibus ni Jesus.

45
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,260
Ngarod.

46
00:02:41,940 --> 00:02:43,360
Umunan to dagiti maudi.

47
00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:46,280
Ket mauding to dagiti umuna.

48
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:51,020
Idisumangsang at ni Jesus ije Jerusalem,

49
00:02:51,700 --> 00:02:54,680
inyadayuna dagiti sang apulokit duwang adalan

50
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:58,120
kit kinasaritan na ita bayat tipan nagnada.

51
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,920
Kinunana kadakwada.

52
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:04,340
Deng ganyo, sumangat tayo ije Jerusalem,

53
00:03:04,940 --> 00:03:09,040
ket mayawat to sa djay ti anak ti tao kadagiti panguluen apapadi

54
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:11,900
ken kadagiti mamaestro iti linteg.

55
00:03:12,980 --> 00:03:17,640
Ikat deng danto amapapatay sa danto yawat kadagiti hintil amangang angaw.

56
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:22,160
Mang sapsaplit, ken manglilan sa ken kwana iti krus.

57
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:26,460
Ngem, mapagungar to iti maikatlongal daw.

58
00:03:26,660 --> 00:03:29,460
Ima si Degnesus iti asawa ni Sebedeus.

59
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,740
Diyo, agraman dagiti anak na alalaki,

60
00:03:33,260 --> 00:03:37,340
nagparintomong itisangwanan na kit nagdawat kin kwana.

61
00:03:37,980 --> 00:03:38,980
Anya ti kayat mo?

62
00:03:39,780 --> 00:03:41,000
Sinaludsod ni Jesus.

63
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:43,220
Simong bat ti ina?

64
00:03:43,940 --> 00:03:45,960
Palubos mo kumangain to nagari ka,

65
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,920
makitugato kin ka dagit tuidwa nga anak ko,

66
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,980
timaysa iti makanawan mo,

67
00:03:51,220 --> 00:03:53,020
kit tisabali iti makanigid mo.

68
00:03:53,860 --> 00:03:55,620
Diyo amot, itaw dawatin niyo.

69
00:03:56,380 --> 00:03:58,760
Kinunana ni Jesus kadagiti agkabsat.

70
00:03:59,120 --> 00:03:59,840
Kabailan niya.

71
00:03:59,840 --> 00:03:59,860
Kabailan niya.

72
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:02,480
Kailan niyo kadinga uminom iti kopa apag inumak?

73
00:04:03,220 --> 00:04:05,000
